    {
     "key": "ctrl+Z"
    },
    {
     "log_value": "(function(){var h=null,n=null,js=null,x={};try{h=fw.historyPalette;n=h.getStepCount();}catch(e){x.count_err=String(e);}if(n!==null){var a=[];for(var i=0;i<n;i++)a.push(i);try{js=h.getStepsAsJavaScript(a);}catch(e){js=\"ERR \"+e;}}try{x.sel=String(h.getSelection());}catch(e){x.sel_err=String(e);}try{x.docs=fw.documents.length;}catch(e){}var o=[n,js,x];try{return o.toSource();}catch(e){return JSON.stringify(o);}})()"
    }
   ],
   "shot": null,
   "note": "R-14 (TW-132 a): every history call guarded (run 18: getStepCount() outside the try gave script error -2147216344); [count, steps, {errors, selection, documents}] - the runner shows the History panel and reads again when the error comes back; R-22 (TW-155 c, run 24: the reference's History read-back ran with 2 documents open and read 0 steps): every document closed before the reopen, so the History belongs to the only document"
